{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Nisha. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi Nisha, I'm Emily Wilson. I've been having a lot of trouble with my phone and I'm really frustrated with the service lately.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am sorry to hear that you are experiencing issues. I can certainly look into this for you. Before we dive into the account details, could you please provide your account number?",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Yes, it is 92856959.",
    "tags": ["identity_verification"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. I have your account open now. What exactly is happening with your device?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "My screen is flickering and the battery is draining way too fast. I think the device is faulty.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I see. I would suggest that you try a factory reset of the device first to see if that resolves the software issues.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I've already tried that and it didn't work. I want to change my plan to something with a better device insurance coverage, because this phone is a piece of junk.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I can help you change your plan to one that includes better coverage. I will update the plan on your account now.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Will that fix my current phone immediately or get me a replacement?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I cannot say for sure if that will resolve the device issue or provide a replacement right now.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "This is ridiculous! I'm paying for a service that doesn't work and you're not giving me any clear answers. I am extremely dissatisfied with this whole experience!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I understand your frustration, but I am following the company policy regarding device claims.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I don't care about policy! I just want a working phone and a plan that actually helps me when things go break!",
    "tags": []
    },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I will keep the plan change request pending in the system. Goodbye.",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
